# Purpose: This file excludes directories and files from AI context scanning
# to improve performance and focus on relevant source code.

# Swift Package Manager
# Excludes all build artifacts and package caches. The .build directory
# contains compiled sources, dependencies, and other intermediate files.
.build/
.swiftpm/

# Xcode
# Excludes user-specific project files and the DerivedData directory where
# Xcode stores its own build products and indexes.
*.xcodeproj/
*.xcworkspace/
DerivedData/

# Version Control
.git/

# Documentation
# READMEs and other markdown files are generally not needed for code analysis.
*.md
Documentation/